  "plain": "A podcast host, Jesse Michels, says that in the 1990s Ron Pandolfi, a man at the CIA (America's foreign intelligence agency), told President Bill Clinton he should get a briefing from Bruce Maccabee. Maccabee, Michels explains, had written a book about UFOs and the FBI, America's federal police agency. If true, it would mean a sitting president was being pointed toward someone who studied UFOs."
